{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/c/dec99246bb21f9fedc04fb1de86e414cb13e0fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+px^2+qx+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" /> is a cubic with a double root at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and another root at b, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are real numbers.\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/0095c55d45a29d3597215b42ce695b1d0065d36b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/c/f7cafcd187fd3c9f1e61cacf7300d49083f60621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/9/ce9ecf59fc19a4940f62291f768bbfafbe1457dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }0\\qquad \\text{(B) }4\\qquad \\text{(C) }108\\qquad \\text{(D) It could be }0 \\text{ or } 4\\qquad \\text{(E) It could be }0 \\text{ or } 108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"606\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af0fb4acf821528009eaf2c035a866a60cb3aece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(F) }18\\qquad \\text{(G) }-4\\qquad \\text{(H) }-108\\qquad \\text{(I) It could be } 0 \\text{ or } -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"468\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/2/f32e0c76c1b3002aaebb81871cc0b088451503ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(J) It could be } 0 \\text{ or } {-108} \\qquad \\text{(K) It could be } 4 \\text{ or } {-4}\\qquad \\text{(L) There is no such value of } r\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"653\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/9159e8fdf469ac755d045d89829438bc48adda35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(M) } 1 \\qquad \\text{(N) } {-2} \\qquad  \\text{(O)  It could be } 4 \\text{ or } -4 \\qquad \\text{(P)  It could be } 0 \\text{ or } -2 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"559\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/a/11abf2fc9b08ce2ec9d2b45f55e2d370c506b163.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(Q)  It could be } 2007 \\text{ or a yippy dog} \\qquad \\text{(R)  } 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"363\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a01785b1ddd3bceb36d45d124faeac7db1f7b0ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a+b = 6\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7f5c275af02ac020a19508a9caafcd674b12327.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2ab + a^2 = 9\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />\nFrom the first equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999b35931820dde6904e9bce06f8a725df6addb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -2a+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"14\" />.  Substitute into the second equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c100cf800345c34b05fe7bc11dc8ad73c9c0a83c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-4a^2 + 12a + a^2 = 9\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531fc2701a6c5f11759cd9a49c968b43b641fea8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-3a^2 + 12a - 9 = 0\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e92ea46538113e6b9694d2e28b0a124810ac1596.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 - 4a + 3 = 0\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7a58270d4285821716c6093a83541f3ea31dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 0$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, so by Vieta's Formulas, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/545933c25a1802d9dbcfc24ab4c013d07ef4ccbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 0$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb996ca207df5d210cd86914aed764adb55fcb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, so by Vieta's Formulas, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bcf9a1238abfbd7d51139c9a0e59ac22535af4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/985d6e02b5948ce107ff60c73fa7d45fb20408ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(I)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"33\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The equation of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polynomial\" title=\"Polynomial\">polynomial</a> with double root <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and single root <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c5861567dd865481cb76f2defe4647d57424959.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-a)^2 (x-b)\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"19\" />\nExpanding the polynomial results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/b/3fb03f71352f96f53cf81e04b8db9fb94f9a3b3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2 - 2ax + a^2)(x-b)\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea340431e67d0911058b64157176fd9a529a6810.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 - (2a+b)x^2 + (2ab+a^2)x - a^2b\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"19\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/2/49236f26e1808e302f8ee9b1fc0e8fc5d465886a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/8565e36d3b21a5d759034af51eafa0fda74e3531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, we can write a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\">system of equations</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a01785b1ddd3bceb36d45d124faeac7db1f7b0ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a+b = 6\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7f5c275af02ac020a19508a9caafcd674b12327.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2ab + a^2 = 9\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />\nSolving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7a58270d4285821716c6093a83541f3ea31dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 0$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/545933c25a1802d9dbcfc24ab4c013d07ef4ccbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = 0$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb996ca207df5d210cd86914aed764adb55fcb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bcf9a1238abfbd7d51139c9a0e59ac22535af4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />.  Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/985d6e02b5948ce107ff60c73fa7d45fb20408ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(I)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"33\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-s